// Larchhill (band lane, 2026-11-22; D:/LQOnline/world3/BRIEF.md section 4): levels 20 to 25, its own outdoor zone
// (src/data/maps/larchhill.js, generated by tools/maps/zone_larchhill.mjs). Plain data, merged into the content by
// src/data/maps/index.js: its people, quest items and rewards, quests, its two rares and its zone event. The foes are in
// src/data/band20.js (shared with Drovers' Reach and the Larch Mine).
//
// The story: past the Downs' old shut gate lies a larch valley of beekeepers, sawyers and silver miners. Lately grey
// couriers come and go on the south road, sealing every letter cold, hiring cudgels, buying silence. They carry lists
// of names in the same cold, careful hand Elder Mael has seen before. Their captain keeps the Grey Post; her orders send
// the list on west, down the drove roads. Under it all the Larch Mine still holds the shift the blackdamp took.
// Text is original. No em dashes.
import { BAND_JUNK, bandRare, questItem, rewardGear, whereIn, bandQuest } from './band20.js';

